nsh pull request #1014 (https://github.com/longbridge/nsh/pull/1014), upstream commit
0d0338ac55e94a004acdb59a333356410c3530c4 in https://github.com/longbridge/nsh, unchanged:
js: Keep a live memo's value when its object is collected (#1014)
A live computed's value in a cycle with its object was freed by the collector while the graph still held it;
the memo's next run freed it again. Herdr Anywhere's chat view crashed on iOS 27 with that stack
(js_free_value_rt <- js_array_finalizer <- free_gc_object).

